                                "sense_id": "ebdddc7e-c0ea-3f01-89ec-a483480f136e",
                                "text": "There is Pump Court and Fountain Court, with their hydraulic apparatus, but one never heard of a bencher disporting in the fountain; and can’t but think how many a counsel learned in the law of old days might have benefited by the pump."
